# The public gallery has no browser-visible runtime configuration.
# Do not place wallet keys, API keys, Supabase credentials, contract authority,
# deployment secrets, service-role credentials, or preview controls in VITE_*.
# Local presentation is a development environment, not a role badge or runtime authority.
# The dev server requires both a valid asymmetric startup signature and localhost
# ?role=PUBLIC|PRACTITIONER|STEWARD. Keep the private key outside distributable
# material. Production builds reject HIEN_SINH_LOCAL_PRESENTATION_* and retired
# VITE_EXPERIENCE_REVIEW_* variables.
